 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how's everything with you?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty well, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.72,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I miss every call because my phone is so quiet. The ringer's on full.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.49,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Is it in a case? Some thick cases cover the speaker holes on the bottom.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.36,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh. Maybe. It's a chunky rubber one.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Try a call with the case off and see. Also check the speaker grille for lint, it gets clogged.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.46,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Without the case it's way louder. Okay then. And at work I keep it",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 1.46,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "on vibrate.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 2.56,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You can choose a stronger vibration pattern in the sound settings. Some are a long heartbeat rather than a short buzz, much easier to notice.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 1.11,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Heartbeat. Love it.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.78,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "And maybe shop for a case with proper cutouts for the speaker.",
